  "body": "This simply reduces visual noise by replacing all the occurences of \"Switch to the <name> state. Reconsume the current input character.\" and \"Switch to the <name> state. Reconsume the EOF character.\" with just \"Reconsume in the <name> state.\" since reconsumption is always about the current character, whether it's EOF or not.\n\nAlso linked all such references to created definition of \"reconsume\".\n",
